    11	#
    12	# 1. Concrete behavior shift:
    13	#    - Original task: 1-5 framed 2x2 blocks, each frame may have multiple gaps, and
    14	#      collision may or may not happen depending on free placement.
    15	#    - Combo task: exactly two frames, each with exactly one structural gap. The two
    16	#      gaps are chosen on the inward-facing sides/corners of the pair, so the two
    17	#      emitted beams must collide once.
